1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,833
Your site today, on a phone.

2
00:00:01,833 --> 00:00:05,633
Three websites, and none of them shows all your trips.

3
00:00:05,633 --> 00:00:08,267
The mock-up: your drone photo, full screen.

4
00:00:08,267 --> 00:00:11,867
Your day in four stops, from your beach to the Blue Lagoon.

5
00:00:11,867 --> 00:00:15,467
All your trips on one page, each with its starting price.

6
00:00:15,467 --> 00:00:20,667
Every price once, in one table, with your terms.

7
00:00:20,667 --> 00:00:24,300
Each trip has its page: photos, video, the day stop by stop.

8
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:29,867
Stafilia, Cave Island, Lindos, the Blue Lagoon.

9
00:00:29,867 --> 00:00:32,500
The price for the group, worked out live.

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,267
Then a date: only days in season can be picked.

11
00:00:35,267 --> 00:00:38,900
Name and WhatsApp. Nothing to pay at this stage.

12
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:42,567
Deposit, weather and cancellation, shown before sending.

13
00:00:42,567 --> 00:00:46,833
Sent. The guest knows what happens next, and when.

14
00:00:46,833 --> 00:00:50,933
Your side: the request arrives complete and priced.

15
00:00:50,933 --> 00:00:54,667
You read the message, already written in the guest’s language.

16
00:00:54,667 --> 00:00:58,700
Second tap: the deposit link goes out. Nothing leaves without you.

17
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:03,167
Strong wind forecast? You decide, then the guests are told.

18
00:01:03,167 --> 00:01:05,767
Private prototype: your photos, your prices.

19
00:01:05,767 --> 00:01:08,367
Next step: 15 minutes together.
